  "body": "Brand new 2-level quality crafted weatherboard home. This is a charming family home located in the picturesque neighbourhood of Half Moon Bay. With its spacious layout and modern finishes, this property is the perfect place for families and individuals looking to settle down in a quiet and friendly community. Featuring four bedrooms, three bathrooms, and a fully-equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances, this home has everything you need to live comfortably. The backyard is an oasis of tranquility, providing the perfect space for outdoor entertaining or simply relaxing in the sun.\r\n\r\nSituated just minutes away from local schools, shopping centres, and parks, this is the perfect place to call home. Zoned for the top schools in East Auckland, these include Wakaaranga School, Macleans Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate, Sancta Maria College and Pakuranga College. The location is just perfect, close to East Auckland finest beaches, Half Moon Bay ferry terminal, Highland Park shops, the historical Howick Village, leisure centres, parks and much more.\r\n\r\nThis is the ultimate low maintenance home for busy families or professionals. Be quick! Quality homes in this area do not last long. Contact us for more information or to view NOW.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View their website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
